2. For non-`NULL` buffers, it will attempt to call the original (assumed weak) `video_buffer_release` implementation. A common Zephyr pattern for weak symbols is to use a `__weak` attribute and a slightly different name for the original function (e.g., `__video_buffer_release_impl`).

